{"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/worldmodule\/world\/runconcurrently(_:)"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/World\/runConcurrently(_:)","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"tokens":[{"text":"mutating","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"runConcurrently","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"_","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"changes","kind":"internalParam"},{"text":": [","kind":"text"},{"text":"ConcurrentChange","kind":"typeIdentifier","identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/ConcurrentChange","preciseIdentifier":"s:11WorldModule16ConcurrentChangeV"},{"text":"])","kind":"text"}],"platforms":["Linux"],"languages":["swift"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"parameters":[{"name":"changes","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The changes to run.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"kind":"parameters"},{"content":[{"text":"Discussion","type":"heading","anchor":"discussion","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Use this method to spread independent work across the processor’s cores. Each change reads"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the world as it was before any of them ran, and writes only the types its access lists, so"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the result is the same as running the changes one after another in any order:"}]},{"code":["var world = World()","let ball = world.spawn(Position(x: 0, y: 0), Velocity(dx: 1, dy: 0), Health(current: 10))","","world.runConcurrently([","    ConcurrentChange(access: .reads(Velocity.self).writes(Position.self)) { world in","        world.update(Position.self, reading: Velocity.self) { position, row in","            position.x += row.components.dx","        }","    },","    ConcurrentChange(access: .writes(Health.self)) { world in","        world.update(Health.self) { health, _ in health.current -= 1 }","    },","])","","print(world[Position.self, of: ball].x, world[Health.self, of: ball].current)","\/\/ Prints \"1.0 9\""],"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A change sees the components and resources that other changes write as missing, so its"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"access must list everything it reads. Command buffers a change queues with "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/World\/queue(_:)","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"are queued in this world in the order of "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"changes"},{"type":"text","text":"."}]},{"style":"important","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A change must write only the component and resource types its access lists,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and must not spawn or despawn entities. It writes relations through their "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/Targets","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"components, and the hierarchy through "},{"code":"Targets<ChildOf>","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":"."}]}],"type":"aside","name":"Important"},{"style":"note","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"O(","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"c"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"text":"·","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"t"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"text":"), besides the cost of the changes themselves, where ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"c"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"text":" is the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"number of changes and ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"t","type":"text"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"text":" is the number of component types the world has stored.","type":"text"}]}],"type":"aside","name":"Complexity"},{"style":"note","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"No two accesses conflict, and each change writes only what its access","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"lists and spawns and despawns nothing; a change that breaks this traps. In debug builds,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"a change that reads a component or resource type its access doesn’t list traps too. Any","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"change may read ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/Disabled"},{"text":" and ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/Prefab"},{"text":".","type":"text"}]}],"type":"aside","name":"Precondition"}],"kind":"content"}],"kind":"symbol","hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule","doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/World"]]},"metadata":{"modules":[{"name":"WorldModule"}],"externalID":"s:11WorldModule0A0V15runConcurrentlyyySayAA16ConcurrentChangeVGF","symbolKind":"method","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"runConcurrently","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"([","kind":"text"},{"text":"ConcurrentChange","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:11WorldModule16ConcurrentChangeV"},{"text":"])","kind":"text"}],"remoteSource":{"url":"https:\/\/github.com\/Tyler-Keith-Thompson\/ECS\/blob\/main\/Sources\/WorldModule\/Concurrency.swift#L264","fileName":"Concurrency.swift"},"extendedModule":"WorldModule","title":"runConcurrently(_:)","roleHeading":"Instance Method"},"sections":[],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Runs changes at the same time, each on its own copy of the world, and keeps what each one"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"wrote."}],"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"major":0,"minor":3},"references":{"doc://WorldModule/documentation/WorldModule/World/queue(_:)":{"title":"queue(_:)","kind":"symbol","type":"topic","fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"queue","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"Commands","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:11WorldModule8CommandsV"},{"text":")","kind":"text"}],"abstract":[{"text":"Adds a command buffer to the world’s queue, to apply later with","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/World\/applyQueuedCommands()"},{"text":".","type":"text"}],"role":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/worldmodule\/world\/queue(_:)","identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/World\/queue(_:)"},"doc://WorldModule/documentation/WorldModule/World":{"title":"World","type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/World","kind":"symbol","role":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/worldmodule\/world","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"World"}],"abstract":[{"text":"A collection of entities, the components they hold, and resources.","type":"text"}],"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"World"}]},"doc://WorldModule/documentation/WorldModule/Targets":{"title":"Targets","identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/Targets","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Targets","kind":"identifier"}],"type":"topic","kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The component that holds a source entity’s targets of a relation, with the relation’s value"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"for each."}],"url":"\/documentation\/worldmodule\/targets","role":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"Targets","kind":"identifier"}]},"doc://WorldModule/documentation/WorldModule/World/runConcurrently(_:)":{"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"runConcurrently"},{"kind":"text","text":"(["},{"text":"ConcurrentChange","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:11WorldModule16ConcurrentChangeV"},{"text":"])","kind":"text"}],"abstract":[{"text":"Runs changes at the same time, each on its own copy of the world, and keeps what each one","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"wrote.","type":"text"}],"type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/worldmodule\/world\/runconcurrently(_:)","title":"runConcurrently(_:)","role":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/World\/runConcurrently(_:)","kind":"symbol"},"doc://WorldModule/documentation/WorldModule/Disabled":{"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"Disabled"}],"type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/worldmodule\/disabled","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A component that makes queries and updates skip an entity, unless they ask for it."}],"kind":"symbol","role":"symbol","title":"Disabled","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"Disabled"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/Disabled"},"doc://WorldModule/documentation/WorldModule/ConcurrentChange":{"title":"ConcurrentChange","url":"\/documentation\/worldmodule\/concurrentchange","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"ConcurrentChange","kind":"identifier"}],"type":"topic","role":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A change to a world, paired with the access that describes what it reads and writes."}],"kind":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"ConcurrentChange","kind":"identifier"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/ConcurrentChange"},"doc://WorldModule/documentation/WorldModule/Prefab":{"url":"\/documentation\/worl